### API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Cache |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/products` | No | ✅ 5 min |
| `GET` | `/api/products/featured` | No | ✅ 10 min |
| `GET` | `/api/products/:slug` | No | ✅ 10 min |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/register` | No | — |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | No | — |
| `POST` | `/api/orders` | ✅ JWT | — |
| `GET` | `/api/orders` | ✅ JWT | — |
| `GET` | `/api/orders/:id` | ✅ JWT | — |
| `POST` | `/api/coupons/validate` | No | — |

---

### Redis Caching Strategy

```
Request → Cache hit? → Return cached data (1ms)
                ↓
           Cache miss → Query Supabase (20ms) → Store in Redis → Return
```

| Key Pattern | TTL | What's Cached |
|---|---|---|
| `products:all` | 5 min | Full product list with variants |
| `products:featured` | 10 min | Featured products only |
| `product:{slug}` | 10 min | Single product detail |
| `rate:{ip}` | 1 min | Rate limiting counter |

