### Frontend Integration

#### [NEW] `src/lib/api.ts`
Base API client using `fetch` with auth token injection.

#### [MODIFY] `src/hooks/useProducts.ts`
Replace static import from [products.ts](file:///d:/projects/PERFUME-WEBSITE/src/data/products.ts) with React Query `useQuery` calls to the API.

#### [MODIFY] [src/pages/Shop.tsx](file:///d:/projects/PERFUME-WEBSITE/src/pages/Shop.tsx), [Home.tsx](file:///d:/projects/PERFUME-WEBSITE/src/pages/Home.tsx), [ProductDetail.tsx](file:///d:/projects/PERFUME-WEBSITE/src/pages/ProductDetail.tsx)
Swap `products` array with `useProducts()` hook data.

#### [MODIFY] [src/pages/Checkout.tsx](file:///d:/projects/PERFUME-WEBSITE/src/pages/Checkout.tsx)
On "Place Order", POST to `/api/orders` and navigate to confirmation with real order ID.

