## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
# Start backend
cd backend && npm run dev        # runs on :3001

# Test endpoints
curl http://localhost:3001/api/products
curl http://localhost:3001/api/products/luxescent-noir-sauvage
```

### Manual Verification
1. Products load from Supabase (not static file)
2. Register a new user account
3. Login and place a test order — appears in Supabase orders table
4. Coupon codes work against the database
5. Redis cache hit/miss logs visible in Upstash dashboard
